sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Emp as Employee
  participant SPA as React SPA
  participant API as RequestsController
  participant WF as WorkflowService
  participant DB as Azure SQL
  participant NS as NotificationService
  participant G as Microsoft Graph
  Emp->>SPA: Choose kind and request type, enter title and description, Submit
  SPA->>API: POST /api/requests {kind, requestTypeId, title, description}<br/>Bearer + x-correlation-id
  API->>API: Policy CanCreateRequest and DataAnnotations validation
  alt Validation, policy or request-type check fails
    API-->>SPA: 400 / 401 / 403
  else Valid
    API->>WF: SubmitAsync
    WF->>DB: One SaveChanges: INSERT PortalRequest (Submitted)<br/>+ INSERT RequestAudit (null → Submitted)
    WF->>NS: RequesterSubmitted
    NS->>G: sendMail (managed identity)
    NS->>DB: NotificationRecord outcome
    opt Access request
      WF->>G: GET /users/{requester}/manager
      alt Manager found
        WF->>DB: One SaveChanges: UnderReview + audit
        WF->>NS: ManagerWaitingApproval, RequesterUnderReview
      else Not found / directory unavailable
        WF->>DB: Stays Submitted, manager notification NotSent / Failed
      end
    end
    API-->>SPA: 201 Created + RequestResponse
  end
